Z60NrfYyhNaegzmYf4J_YiA&oe=69AC1A5A"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "197240355037301", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162788_1346146758798174_2182111697269948416_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=87e1jlLRCoYQ7kNvwGZp1pe&_nc_oc=AdnPiw8C3QAWbnINicflOkrR3HgWV8DC4ONOrkuWYDHgKONTd8PwM-ckLoxniTlC9G0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxosw3CYcjw-2zgUHYK06190x1CFyId_ULoHTMKkZg9CQ&oe=69AC1D41"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Roller Coaster Apocalypse", "keywords": ["roller", "coaster", "apocalypse", "rollercoaster", "netdinamica"], "long_description": "Three roller coasters with a Interactive Roller Coaster\nThree different experiences\n\n-Apocalypse Destruction\nAt this ride you feel inside  the apocalypse\nThe asteroids will destroy everything \nEven the roller coaster you are in can be destroyed\nFeel referents Sensations\n\n-Apocalypse Shoot the Asteroids\nInteractive Roller Coaster ride at apolacalypse environment\nHere you can shoot and destroy the asteroids, with a powerful laser\nYou can ride and make a new score at each new ride.\n\n-Before Apocalypse\nHere you can enjoy a slow ride with no loops at a sunny day.\nAt this experience there is no apocalypse \n\nRoller Coaster at Immersive Apocalypse environment\nYou can ride and feel the Apocalypse environment", "short_description": "Three roller coasters with a Interactive Roller Coaster\nThree different experiences, rides:\n-Apocalypse Destruction\n-Apocalypse Shoot the Asteroids\n-Before Apocalypse\n\nRoller Coaster at Immersive Apocalypse environment\nYou can ride, play and feel the Apocalypse environment\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.netdinamica.com.br/games/rollercoastereapocalypse/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.netdinamica.com.br/games/rollercoastereapocalypse/terms.html", "publisher_name": "NetDinamica", "sup